{"meta":{"id":"err-archive:1038409","type":"series","name":"Mehed ja mõrrad","poster":"https://s.err.ee/photo/orig/2020/10/28/835764h0836.jpg","background":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2019/04/22/628722hd782t34.jpg","genres":["Saated"],"description":"Saatejuhid Anatoli Tafitšuk ja Sten Teppan asuvad uurima, kuidas läheb rannakaluritel. Meie rannajoonel kohtab visiooniga noori ja väsinud taate ning külasid, kus arendatakse kalatööstust ja turismi. Päris kindel on aga see, et Eestis on võimalik saada värsket kala. Esimene saade uurib ja vaatab, kuidas elavad ning millega tegelevad Harjumaa kalurid. Režissöör Kertu Köösel, toimetaja Kerli Dello, produtsent Tiina-Mari Koljak.","videos":[{"id":"err-archive:1608242511","title":"Mehed ja mõrrad","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2014/09/11/579531hbcact34.jpg","released":"2021-06-10"},{"id":"err-archive:1608242514","title":"Mehed ja mõrrad","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2019/04/22/628722hd782t34.jpg","released":"2021-06-10"},{"id":"err-archive:1608249396","title":"Mehed ja mõrrad","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2014/09/13/220906h4bcat34.png","released":"2021-06-16"},{"id":"err-archive:1608249399","title":"Mehed ja mõrrad","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2014/09/11/579531hbcact34.jpg","released":"2021-06-16"},{"id":"err-archive:1608249402","title":"Mehed ja mõrrad","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2019/04/22/628722hd782t34.jpg","released":"2021-06-16"},{"id":"err-archive:1608249405","title":"Mehed ja mõrrad","season":1,"episode":6,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2014/09/13/220906h4bcat34.png","released":"2021-06-16"},{"id":"err-archive:1608253551","title":"Mehed ja mõrrad","season":1,"episode":7,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2014/09/11/579531hbcact34.jpg","released":"2021-06-21"},{"id":"err-archive:1608253554","title":"Mehed ja mõrrad","season":1,"